---
description: Flockcast project rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repository root; it is the source of truth for structure, commands and rules.

Non-negotiables:
- Project and API-key SQL only in src/db/repositories, through app.forUser(userId). Someone else's id answers 404.
- Rehearsals only through app.rehearsals with the project id as scope.
- Errors are AppError / RehearsalError with a stable code; responses are { error: { code, message } }.
- Validate every route input with zod and cap lengths.
- Model keys stay server side: never returned, logged or bundled.
- Free model tier by default; no feature may need a paid service.
- Never copy MiroFish (AGPL) code.
- Run `npm run check` before finishing.
